      "value": "This may be similar to my Open Beta Issue I posted  just over a month ago here feel free to compare and post back if your getting the same thing with the right controller issues,\n\nThe issue is still happening in the open beta for me over a month on but last couple beta updates not as often it seems.\nDon't know if they accidently pushed the bugged code I brought up to live without realising the cause as a update to improve things somewhere.\n\nBut if the bug is now also on the live stable then VRChat will need to seriously need to look into this.\n\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/crashing-on-exit-and-oculus-touch-controller-issues",
      "viewerReactions": null
